[ti:Afterlight]
[ar:LYRICSCAPE]
[al:Signals in the Dark]
[length:04:10]
[by:LYRICSCAPE — original lyrics. Music: "Ossuary 6 - Air" by Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com), CC BY 4.0]

[00:16.00]♪
[00:38.00]The city holds its breath tonight
[00:44.50]I traced the road back in my head
[00:51.00]Every light we left behind
[00:57.50]still burning where the map has bled
[01:05.00]You were a window, half awake
[01:12.00]I was the weather moving through
[01:19.00]So tell me how the silence breaks
[01:26.00]when all it ever says is you
[01:46.00]Hold the line, the dark is wide
[01:52.00]We are the afterlight
[01:58.00]Everything we were survives
[02:04.00]folded in the night
[02:11.00]Carry me across the void
[02:17.00]slow as falling snow
[02:24.00]Whatever the morning destroys
[02:31.00]the afterlight will know
[02:40.00]♪
[02:50.00]Quiet now, the engine cools
[02:57.00]I keep your voice on the lowest sound
[03:04.00]a small horizon I can hold
[03:11.00]when the whole sky comes down
[03:20.00]Hold the line, the dark is wide
[03:25.50]We are the afterlight
[03:31.00]Everything we were survives
[03:36.50]folded in the night
[03:42.00]Carry me across the void
[03:47.50]slow as falling snow
[03:53.00]Whatever the morning destroys
[03:58.50]the afterlight will know
[04:04.00]the afterlight will know
[04:09.00]♪
